{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0265","paragraphs":[{"id":"p31c1dfa92687-1","text":"落花已作风前舞。"},{"id":"p488b36097f58-1","text":"又送黄昏雨。"},{"id":"p6074e2ef355a-1","text":"晓来庭院半残红。"},{"id":"p5943f94640f6-1","text":"惟有游丝千丈、晴空。"},{"id":"pf7a7fc369b13-1","text":"殷勤花下同携手。"},{"id":"pa792ec190218-1","text":"更尽杯中酒。"},{"id":"p3a904fc91c5c-1","text":"美人不用敛蛾眉。"},{"id":"p9e33bbeae01b-1","text":"我亦多情、无奈酒阑时。"}]}